{"id":"f5c9997bcd6a","path":"/en/education/master/oncology/contacts","lang":"en","title":"Contact us","description":"The Study Advisory Service is always available for information on USI's Degrees. Call us or send us an email today.","section":"Education","crumbs":["Education","Master","MOTIA"],"image":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/styles/usi_large/public/storage/images/orientamento-correzione_obiettivo_-_9.jpg?itok=P92hDBzr","words":112,"alternates":{},"breadcrumb":[{"label":"Home","path":"/en"},{"label":"Education","path":"/en/originalnode/8525"},{"label":"Master","path":"/en/originalnode/7757"},{"label":"MOTIA","path":"/en/education/master/oncology"},{"label":"Contact us","path":null}],"blocks":[{"t":"gallery","items":[{"kind":"image","src":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/styles/usi_large/public/storage/images/orientamento-correzione_obiettivo_-_9.jpg?itok=P92hDBzr","alt":"orientamento-correzione_obiettivo_-_9","caption":""}]},{"t":"html","html":"<p>The Study Advisory Service is available for study orientation meetings and general information about the University.</p> <p>The service offers the following contact methods and schedules:</p> <ul> <li>Desk (Via Buffi 13, Lugano, office 320): Monday to Friday from 9:00 AM to 12:00 PM and from 2:00 PM to 5:00 PM</li> <li>Phone +41 58 666 4795: available in the morning from Tuesday to Friday from 9:00 AM to 12:00 PM, and in the afternoon on Monday, Tuesday, and Thursday from 2:00 PM to 5:00 PM.</li> <li>Personalized consultations by appointment, available in person or remotely via Microsoft Teams, can be booked on <a href=\"https://join.usi.ch/en/book-a-meeting\">this webpage</a>.</li> </ul> <p>For general inquiries, you can fill out the form:</p> <p><strong><a href=\"https://join.usi.ch/en/contact-form\">Contact us</a></strong></p>"}],"ctas":[],"nav":[{"label":"Master in Oncology, Translational Immunology and Aging","href":"/en/education/master/oncology"},{"label":"Study plan","href":"/en/education/mas